flowchart LR
    USER[Requester / Agent / Admin] --> BROWSER[Browser UI]
    BROWSER -->|HTTPS| SERVER[SvelteKit server]
    SERVER --> AUTH[Authentication and permissions]
    SERVER --> VALID[Input validation]
    AUTH --> DB[Drizzle database operations]
    VALID --> DB
    DB <--> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
    SERVER -->|Authorized response| BROWSER
